WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.493
Step 1. Open the consent details.

1.2
00:00:02.493 --> 00:00:07.998
You mark a consent as entered in error by setting its status to Entered in Error.

1.3
00:00:07.998 --> 00:00:12.848
From the Consents tab, select See Details on the consent's card.

2.1
00:00:12.848 --> 00:00:18.063
Step 2. Open the edit form. Select Edit beside Consent Details.

2.2
00:00:18.063 --> 00:00:21.163
Care opens the Edit Consent form.

3.1
00:00:21.163 --> 00:00:23.849
Mark a consent as entered in error.

3.2
00:00:23.849 --> 00:00:27.537
In Status, select Entered in Error, then select Save.

3.3
00:00:27.537 --> 00:00:33.314
Care does not delete or hide the consent; it stays on the Consents tab with the new

3.4
00:00:33.314 --> 00:00:35.023
status.
